// Manifest-only resource script.
//
// Embeds the UAC requireAdministrator manifest at resource type 24
// (RT_MANIFEST), name id 1 — without emitting a VERSIONINFO block.
// This avoids the CVT1100 "duplicate resource" linker error that
// occurred when winres's auto-generated VERSIONINFO collided with
// the one Tauri's build pipeline already emits.
1 24 "manifest.xml"
